  "plain": "In 2011, a dive team that had found a strange object on the floor of the Baltic Sea is said to have filmed smoke rising from the water above it, \"as if it's fuming or emitting gas.\" Michels says this on an episode with Dennis Asberg, the Swedish treasure hunter whose team found the object, telling it as part of the team's account. If true, it would suggest the object on the seabed is somehow still active."
